                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>讲授为主。以基本概念、基本理论、基本方法的讲解为主，同时辅以课堂教学实践活动（分组讨论、案例研讨）、专题案例分析报告撰写等。</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
